julia: draft minimal rotation helper for docs (very small):
```js
// docs/snippets/rotate.js
function startRotation(getToken, apply){
  let stopped = false;
  async function loop(){
    if (stopped) return;
    const t = await getToken();
    apply(t);
    setTimeout(loop, 50 * 60 * 1000);
  }
  loop();
  return () => { stopped = true; };
}
module.exports = startRotation;
```
omar: nice. add a stop handle comment and a short security note: do not log tokens.
